This is an unofficial container build and WebUI for shairport-sync.

It is not affiliated with Mike Brady, the shairport-sync project, Apple, UGREEN, or any Apple audio product.

The shairport-sync source is MIT licensed. Keep the upstream copyright and permission notice when redistributing modified binaries or source.

Local modification:

- In shairport.c, the hard-coded line:
  config.model = strdup("ShairportSync");
  is replaced during Docker build with:
  { const char *_sps_m = getenv("SPS_MODEL");
    config.model = strdup((_sps_m && *_sps_m) ? _sps_m : "ShairportSync"); }

This only changes the advertised model identifier used by Apple clients to choose an icon. It does not make the receiver a real HomePod, AirPort Express, or Apple TV, and it does not add Siri, HomePod stereo pairing, Apple TV default-output integration, or other Apple-only capabilities.
